          <li><a href="/capabilities">Capability map</a> - the eight question areas behind the 19-tool core spine.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="cta-box" style="margin-top:32px;">
          <h2 class="screen-type">Run 0.3.0 against your own org.</h2>
          <p>Free, read-only, offline. Start on the synthetic demo org - no Salesforce auth, no sf CLI, nothing to configure - then point it at your own metadata.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-solid" href="/getting-started">get started</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/mcp">try the demo org</a>
            <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={site.github} rel="noopener">changelog on GitHub</a>
